      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS the establishment of such a grouping is necessary and desirable in order to eliminate duplicating functions and waste in the provision of municipal service; to achieve substantial economies in the operation of the City government, and to permit effective and productive program planning and systems analysis, program coordination and evaluation, budgetary review and evaluation, and management supervision and improvement of programs; and",
